{"articleNo":"473987","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=473987&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2024 K-GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.02.14","hit":"3787","attachments":[{"name":"2024 K-GKS Poster(Eng).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131534"},{"name":"2024 K-GKS Poster(Kor).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131535"},{"name":"0. KIT's own requirements and design for K-GKS.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131697"},{"name":"1. 2024 K-GKS Application guidlines for graduate degrees.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131698"},{"name":"2. 2024 K-GKS 외국인 대학원 장학생 모집 요강.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131699"},{"name":"3. 2024 K-GKS Application Forms(최종).docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131700"},{"name":"4. ★2024 K-GKS Available_Field_of_Study_KIT.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=473987&attachNo=131701"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHo0hnAHA1gBQEYGUCqAxAxgSwFFUA3fASQDlCBTAEQFkA6AK3gHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><a name=\"_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">2024&nbsp;</span></b></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0900FF\">K-GKS Admission Call</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;for Graduate School Studying\nat KIT, Korea</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">We are pleased to inform you of\n2024&nbsp;<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">K-GKS (K-Global Korea\nScholarship)</b> Guidelines for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in Korea.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">As the one and only national\nengineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate\ncandidates up to 10 for this K-GKS admission. This might be a great opportunity\nfor you to be able to study in Korea with a full regional government\nscholarship and to settle down with decent jobs supported by Gyeongsangbuk-do\nand KIT.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please see attached for further\ninformation and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please\nsend me&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">one\noriginal application document package by post and one scanned soft copy by\nE-mail no later than April 19th, (Friday), 2024</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">. Your original application\ndocuments must be delivered to my office by the deadline.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">1.&nbsp;Scholarship\nDuration<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Master's Degree Program(2 yrs),\nDoctoral Degree Program(3 yrs)</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">*K-GKS recipients who will be\nenrolled in Kumoh National Institute of Technology will be able to pursue one’s\ndegree program on September 1<sup>st</sup>, 2024. One year of Korean language\nprogram is exempted. </span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">2.\nRequired Language Proficiency Test Result<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Applicants <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal\">MUST</b> submit one of below official language proficiency test\ncertificates.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- minimum language proficiency\ntest certificate: TOPIK level 3, TOEIC 750, TOEFL PBT 550, TOEFL ibt 79, TEPS\n327, IELTS 6.0 or higher <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- Eligibility requirements are\nlimited to the results of the language test taken within the last two years as\nof the application deadline for K-GKS admission<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">- If candidates are from the\ncountry where English is spoken as first language (USA, Canada, UK, Ireland,\nAustralia, New Zealand), the English proficiency test will not be\nrequired to hand in<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">3.\nEligibility<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please refer to the attached K-GKS\nApplication Guidelines<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">4. Obligation for K-GKS\nrecipients<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">-\nK-GKS recipients are obligated to either find a job at local companies or\npursue higher degree at universities located in Gyeongsangbuk-do and to\nmaintain residency in Gyeongsangbuk-do for three years after one’s graduation. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">-\nK-GKS final nominees must attend “Gyeongbuk Global School” program before the\nstart of the semester. Gyeongbuk Global School will last two weeks in August\n2024, and is a program that introduces policy of Gyeongsangbuk-do and provides\nscholars with opportunities to experience Korean culture, laws and etc., to\nhelp them study and settle in Gyeongsangbuk-do. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">All required documents must be\nwritten by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no\ne-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application for this\nK-GKS admission.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">For further information, please\nsee attached, visit website (</span></span><a href=\"https://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">https://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">)\nor contact K-GKS coordinator.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Below\nis the deadline and the address for the application. Thank you. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission Deadline:&nbsp;April 19<sup>th</sup>(Friday),\n2024<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission Address:</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">[English]<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea,</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><s